<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Corpses (200)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>corpses
</pre>
<p>Lists every player's corpse in the game, and where it is: in a room, 
with the room's symbolic name (room@zone) so you can goto it, or carried 
by someone. Each line says whether the corpse is empty or still holds 
things, and whether it is buried.
</p><p>Handy when a player can't find their corpse (see <a cmd='#'>Help Die</a>). It is 
logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Goto</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Transfer</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Die</a>
</pre>




</div>